Use winter-inspired details such as:

- Snowflakes.
- Soft snow effects.
- Snow-covered visual accents.
- Red-and-white winter candy-cane decorations.
- Festive cookies.
- Subtle winter illustrations.
- Seasonal badges.
- Santa-themed accents.
