- Snowflakes should be lightweight.
- Animation must not block interaction.
- Snow should not reduce text readability.
- Avoid excessive particle counts.
- Respect reduced-motion preferences.
- Avoid causing performance problems on low-end devices.
- Ensure effects do not interfere with scrolling or clicking.

Use CSS or an efficient existing animation approach.

